_url":"https://tech.bm-sms.co.jp/entry/2021/04/27/120000","original_url":"https://tech.bm-sms.co.jp/entry/2021/04/27/120000"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OEd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08f51d10-6824-41c1-8922-efcfe8cde634","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"JIRAは地雷","ts":"1619502465.092800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"dajare","count":2,"users":["UD1FQV38V","UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kRM2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"787e5562-4093-4f1c-a97d-eb14a4f46508","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"亀だけどアトラシアン製品、ドキュメントがアレすぎて知らない機能がいっぱい...","ts":"1619501227.092700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=2Gb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a816b321-05d4-48d4-b0db-5029767ff772","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、でもページテンプレート機能とかは便利\nなんというか全部が全部悪いわけじゃないんだけど、いいのと悪いのの差が激しいんだよな...","ts":"1619499268.092000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ths+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dbffb251-587e-4bbb-b971-070f367478a9","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"ありゃ markdown で書けても辛い、と思ってますが、十中八九参照してるバージョンは違いそう...ｗ","ts":"1619499037.090900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P=7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"356f9c72-13ad-4599-a716-4760b09e6cc8","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"JIRAとかその辺のツールはスキマ時間でチェックするから、個人的にはスマホからの操作性を重要視しているんですけどJIRAはかなりイラっとした記憶がある。","ts":"1619497101.089700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j5="}]},{"client_msg_id":"86c3c670-3343-4025-b188-7f5458faba84","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Vimとの親和性を除いて考慮してもクソ判定なので救われない","ts":"1619496730.087700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_ori